## Title: CasualClean
## Author: Th3rtythr33
## Version: 1.5.0
## AddOnVersion: 9
## APIVersion: 101050
## Description: A more minimal, immersive HUD. Mag/Stam Arcs flank your reticle, fading in only when a resource is spent and replacing the default magicka and stamina bars; they run everywhere, including Cyrodiil, Battlegrounds, Dungeons and Trials. Separately, the companion unit frame is hidden and your companion is marked with a follower icon over their head that shifts from green to yellow to red as their health drops, showing an X if they die; when they're off-screen the icon clamps to the screen edge and an arrow points toward them. The companion features disable themselves in Cyrodiil and Battlegrounds always, and in Dungeons/Trials while grouped.
## DependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings
## SavedVariables: CasualCleanVars

CasualClean.lua
UI/MagStamArcs.xml
UI/MagStamArcs.lua
Settings.lua
